			(property "Description" "QRE1113 Reflective Object Sensor\n\nThe QRE1113 is a small IR reflectance sensor. This sensor is often used in line following robots because, if it can sense if a surface is white or black.\n\nThere are four pins on the QRE1113 - two control the IR emitting LED while the other two are the collector and emitter of a phototransistor. The IR diode has a max forward current of 50mA and operates at 940nm.\n\nhttp://www.sparkfun.com/datasheets/Components/SMD/QRE1113.GR.pdf Datasheet\n\nSparkFun Products\n\n• https://www.sparkfun.com/products/9542 IR Reflectance Sensor - QRE1113 (COM-09542)\n• https://www.sparkfun.com/products/9453 SparkFun Line Sensor Breakout - QRE1113 (Analog) (ROB-09453)\n• https://www.sparkfun.com/products/9454 SparkFun Line Sensor Breakout - QRE1113 (Digital) (ROB-09454)\n• https://www.sparkfun.com/products/11769 SparkFun RedBot Sensor - Line Follower (SEN-11769)\n• https://www.sparkfun.com/products/12617 SparkFun RedBot Sensor - Wheel Encoder (SEN-12617)\n• https://www.sparkfun.com/products/13582 SparkFun Line Follower Array (SEN-13582)"
				(at 0 0 0)
